# app3d/WalkerUi — the walker examples' per-frame UI (136, 137, 143):
# device input into the ECS UI world, the "..." mode menu, the clip,
# transport and character-switch panels, the settings panel, and the UI
# layout systems. uiUpdate returns a UiTick because two of its outcomes
# (settingsChanged and scrolled) feed the app's render decision.
